The '''[[2018–19 in Scottish football|2018–19 season]]''' was [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]]'s 130th season of competitive football. They competed in the [[2018–19 Scottish Premiership|Scottish Premiership]], [[2018–19 Scottish Cup|Scottish Cup]], [[2018–19 Scottish League Cup|League Cup]], [[2018–19 UEFA Champions League|UEFA Champions League]] and [[2018–19 UEFA Europa League|UEFA Europa League]]. Celtic won all three domestic tournaments, completing an unprecedented [[Treble (association football)|treble]].<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/16221 | title=Celtic make history with Treble triumph at Hampden | publisher=[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] | date=25 May 2019 | access-date=25 May 2019 | archive-date=25 May 2019 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190525164845/http://www.celticfc.net/news/16221 | url-status=live }}</ref>

==Pre-season and friendlies==
Celtic preceded the 2018–19 campaign with a pre-season tour of Austria, with matches against [[SK Vorwärts Steyr]], [[Bohemians 1905]], [[FC Blau-Weiß Linz|Blau-Weiß Linz]] and [[AC Sparta Prague|Sparta Prague]].<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/14503 | title=Celtic set for trio of pre-season matches in Austria | publisher=[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] | date=14 June 2018 | access-date=14 June 2018 | archive-date=14 June 2018 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180614121434/http://www.celticfc.net/news/14503 | url-status=live }}</ref> They also faced [[Shamrock Rovers F.C.|Shamrock Rovers]]<ref>{{cite web | url=https://shamrockrovers.ie/2018/05/21/9275/ | title=Celtic to come to Tallaght in July | publisher=[[Shamrock Rovers F.C.|Shamrock Rovers]] | date=21 May 2018 | access-date=14 June 2018 | archive-date=14 June 2018 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180614121843/https://shamrockrovers.ie/2018/05/21/9275/ | url-status=live }}</ref> and [[Standard Liège]].<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/14482 | title=Celtic to take on Standard Liege in pre-season friendly | publisher=[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] | date=5 June 2018 | access-date=14 June 2018 | archive-date=14 June 2018 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180614122050/http://www.celticfc.net/news/14482 | url-status=live }}</ref>

