==Scottish Premiership==
{{Main|2018–19 Scottish Premiership}}

The [[2018–19 Scottish Premiership|Scottish Premiership]] fixture list was announced on 15 June 2018.<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/14506 | title=Celtic to kick off new season with Flag Day game against Livingston | publisher=[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] | date=15 June 2018 | access-date=15 June 2018 | archive-date=15 June 2018 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180615111653/http://www.celticfc.net/news/14506 | url-status=live }}</ref> Celtic began their title defence against newly promoted [[Livingston F.C.|Livingston]] at [[Celtic Park]].

