===Third qualifying round===
On 1 August, it was determined that Celtic would face [[AEK Athens F.C.|AEK Athens]] (Greece) in the third qualifying round of the [[2018–19 UEFA Champions League|UEFA Champions League]]. The Bhoys were eliminated following a 3–2 defeat on aggregate and parachuted into the [[2018–19 UEFA Europa League qualifying phase and play-off round|UEFA Europa League play-off round]].<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/14747 | title=Euro frustration for Celtic at Paradise against AEK Athens | publisher=[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] | date=8 August 2018 | access-date=17 August 2018 | archive-date=17 August 2018 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180817225823/http://www.celticfc.net/news/14747 | url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/14777 | title=Euro heartache for Hoops in Athens | publisher=[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] | date=14 August 2018 | access-date=17 August 2018 | archive-date=17 August 2018 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180817225631/http://www.celticfc.net/news/14777 | url-status=live }}</ref>

