===Group stage===
On 30 August, the draw for the [[2018–19 UEFA Europa League#Group stage|2018–19 UEFA Europa League group stage]] was made. Celtic were drawn in [[2018–19 UEFA Europa League#Group B|Group B]] along with [[FC Red Bull Salzburg|Red Bull Salzburg]] (Pot 1), [[RB Leipzig]] (Pot 3) and [[Rosenborg BK|Rosenborg]] (Pot 4).<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/14871 | title=Celtic's UEFA Europa League group-stage opponents | publisher=[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] | date=31 August 2018 | access-date=31 August 2018 | archive-date=31 August 2018 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180831174702/http://www.celticfc.net/news/14871 | url-status=live }}</ref>

