===Kit===
'''Supplier:''' [[New Balance]] / '''Sponsors:''' [[Dafabet]] (front) and [[Magners]] (back)

The club is in the fourth year of a deal with manufacturer [[New Balance]].<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.net/news/7784 | title=Global sports giant New Balance to be Celtic's official kit supplier | publisher=[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] | date=5 March 2015 | access-date=2 July 2017 | archive-date=28 April 2018 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180428181846/http://www.celticfc.net/news/7784 | url-status=live }}</ref> The kit range for the 2018–19 season is inspired by the ''Bold Bhoys'' and marks 115 years since the club first used green and white hoops on the jersey.

